## 📊 Phase 3: Analysis & Interpretability (分析阶段) — 当前重点
增强论文的说服力，提供可解释性证据。

8.  **E2 (Feature Importance - SHAP) [Done]**
    *   **目标**: 解释 Stage 1 (RF) 的决策依据。
    *   **方法**: SHAP TreeExplainer, 6,068 stratified samples (15 classes, max 500/class), 76 features.
    *   **结果**:
        | 指标 | 值 |
        |---|---|
        | Top-1 Feature | Bwd Packet Length Std (SHAP=0.032) |
        | Top-5 | Bwd Pkt Len Std, Init Bwd Win Bytes, Bwd Pkt Len Mean, Pkt Len Var, Fwd IAT Min |
        | SHAP vs RF Spearman ρ | 0.9444 |
        | SHAP 计算时间 | 235.1s |
    *   **结论**: RF 主要依赖 Payload 长度统计 + IAT 时间特征，与网络安全领域知识一致; SHAP 与 RF Gini 排名高度相关 (ρ=0.94)，但 SHAP 更重视交互特征 (Init Bwd Win Bytes 从 RF#23→SHAP#2).
    *   **产出**: `results/E2_shap_summary.png`, `results/E2_shap_bar.png`, `results/E2_shap_vs_rf.png`, `results/E2_feature_importance.csv`, `results/E2_shap_report.txt`, `results/E2_shap_results.json`.
    *   **总时间**: 239.2s.

9.  **E6 (Confidence Intervals) [Done]**
    *   **目标**: 计算 F1-score 的 95% 置信区间，证明性能评估的统计显著性。
    *   **方法**: 1000× Bootstrap Resampling, Percentile 95% CI.
    *   **数据**: S1 = CIC-IDS2017 20% test (462,762), S2 = Stage 2 hard-example test (67,317).
    *   **结果**:
        | Stage | Metric | Point Est | 95% CI | CI Width |
        |---|---|---|---|---|
        | S1 (RF) | Accuracy | 0.9991 | [0.9990, 0.9992] | 0.0002 |
        | S1 (RF) | W-F1 | 0.9991 | [0.9990, 0.9992] | 0.0002 |
        | S1 (RF) | M-F1 | 0.9982 | [0.9980, 0.9983] | 0.0003 |
        | S2 (TransECA) | Accuracy | 0.9259 | [0.9237, 0.9279] | 0.0042 |
        | S2 (TransECA) | W-F1 | 0.9506 | [0.9491, 0.9520] | 0.0029 |
        | S2 (TransECA) | M-F1 | 0.7658 | [0.7391, 0.8127] | 0.0736 |
    *   **结论**: S1 CI 极窄 (<0.001)，性能估计高度可靠; S2 W-F1 CI 窄 (0.003)，Accuracy CI 约 0.004; S2 M-F1 CI 较宽 (0.074)，反映小类别性能波动大。
    *   **产出**: `results/E6_bootstrap_ci_results.json`, `results/E6_bootstrap_ci_report.txt`, `results/E6_bootstrap_distributions.png`.
    *   **总时间**: 42.9s.

10. **E10 (Interpretability) [Done]**
    *   **目标**: 可视化 Stage 2 TransECA-Net 的决策依据，证明模型关注有意义的网络特征。
    *   **方法**: Integrated Gradients (captum) + Attention Rollout + ECA Channel Attention, 405 IG samples × 50 steps.
    *   **结果**:
        | 方法 | Top-1 Feature | Top-5 |
        |---|---|---|
        | Integrated Gradients | Init Fwd Win Bytes (IG=2.107) | Init Fwd Win Bytes, Flow Packets/s, Bwd Header Length, Fwd Seg Size Min, Fwd Header Length |
        | Attention Rollout | Fwd IAT Mean | Fwd IAT Mean, Fwd Pkt Len Max, Flow Bytes/s, Flow IAT Min, Init Fwd Win Bytes |
        | ECA Channel Attn | mean=0.449, std=0.009, CV=0.020 (低选择性 → 近均匀通道分布) |
    *   **结论**: IG 与 Attention Rollout 都高度重视 Init Fwd Win Bytes (TCP 窗口大小), 与 E2 SHAP (#2 feature) 一致; TransECA-Net 同时关注 IAT 时间统计 + 包长度，符合 IDS 领域知识; ECA 选择性低 (CV=0.02)，与 E8 消融结果一致 (ECA 对 W-F1 贡献小)。
    *   **产出**: `results/E10_ig_global_importance.png`, `results/E10_ig_per_class.png`, `results/E10_attention_heatmap.png`, `results/E10_eca_channel_weights.png`, `results/E10_interpretability_report.txt`, `results/E10_interpretability_results.json`.
    *   **总时间**: 27.8s.

