11. **E14 (Adversarial Robustness) [Done]**
    *   **目标**: 评估分层 IDS 架构在 FGSM/PGD 对抗攻击下的鲁棒性。
    *   **方法**: FGSM (单步) + PGD (5步) on TransECA-Net | L∞ Uniform Noise on RF; ε ∈ {0.001, 0.005, 0.01, 0.05, 0.1}.
    *   **数据**: 10,000 stratified subsample from stage2/test.parquet, XPU (Intel ARC 130T).
    *   **结果**:
        | Attack | Clean Acc | ε=0.001 | ε=0.01 | ε=0.1 |
        |---|---|---|---|---|
        | RF (L∞ noise) | 0.9959 | 0.4694 | 0.0645 | 0.0043 |
        | TransECA FGSM | 0.9216 | 0.9026 | 0.7573 | 0.0609 |
        | TransECA PGD | 0.9216 | 0.9020 | 0.4728 | 0.0066 |
    *   **结论**: RF 对 L∞ 噪声极脆弱 (ε=0.001 即崩溃); TransECA-Net 在小扰动 (ε≤0.01) 下保持较好性能; PGD 比 FGSM 更强 (multi-step 攻击更有效); 分层架构优势: Stage 1 RF 作为鲁棒预过滤器，仅 ~15% 流量到达 DL，限制了对抗攻击的攻击面。
    *   **产出**: `results/E14_adversarial_results.json`, `results/E14_adversarial_report.txt`, `results/E14_robustness_curve.png`, `results/E14_per_class_robustness.png`.
    *   **总时间**: 174.4s.

12. **E4 (Bias-Variance) [Done]**
    *   **目标**: 理论分析 Stage 1 RF 和 Stage 2 TransECA-Net 的 Bias-Variance 特性。
    *   **方法**: (1) RF OOB Error vs Tree Count (warm_start, 10→200 trees); (2) DL Train/Val Loss + Generalization Gap; (3) Model Complexity vs Performance; (4) RF Learning Curve (1%→100% 训练数据).
    *   **数据**: 200K stratified subsample from CIC-IDS2017 (2.3M total), plus S2 epoch log.
    *   **结果**:
        | 分析 | 关键指标 |
        |---|---|
        | RF OOB | n=50→OOB Err=0.00173, n=200→0.00171 (converged, n=50 near-optimal) |
        | DL Gen Gap | Final Train−Val Loss=+0.006 (slight underfitting), trend DECREASING |
        | Complexity | CNN-Only (2.7K params)→61.9% Acc; TransECA (301K)→93.0% (+31%) |
        | RF L-Curve | Gap@1%=0.0106, Gap@100%=0.0016 (low variance) |
    *   **结论**: RF 低 bias + 低 variance (n≥50 收敛); TransECA-Net 中等 bias + 低 variance (gap 稳定); CNN-Only 高 bias → Transformer 是容量关键; 分层设计: RF 处理易分样本 (低 bias), DL 精炼难分样本.
    *   **产出**: `results/E4_oob_vs_trees.png`, `results/E4_dl_learning_curves.png`, `results/E4_complexity_vs_perf.png`, `results/E4_rf_learning_curve.png`, `results/E4_bias_variance_report.txt`, `results/E4_bias_variance_results.json`.
    *   **总时间**: 62.1s.

